      "ailogger": {
        "title": "Ai-Logger",
        "description": "The Ai-Logger is a Modbus TCP slave serving every inverter it polls. It accepts one client at a time, so stop anything else polling it first. Scanning a port reads all 30 of its reserved windows, so pick only the ports that have inverters wired to them.",
